,"session_index":21,"source_sha256":"88f4e5ab66c08d69b0ee687eaacd7dc85df554b8a4b90e31117e7aafdf7d7dd1","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":15},{"dia_id":"D21:16","global_turn_index":367,"locator":"[S21T16]","raw_turn_sha256":"357cdafd62f2b84833ce96166ed5ec2ae12ec2f91369b4e972fc00cd346b4528","rendered_turn_sha256":"3204df1942b4763286c44158eec96f590730135e41e6fe2264a489f60253b779","session_date":"2023-10-04","session_datetime":"2023-10-04T14:44:00","session_id":"session_21","session_index":21,"source_sha256":"811509495accc11ff54941d4073edd8bb96ebfcd2c82ddbc7d14b39cfb5d067d","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":16},{"dia_id":"D21:17","global_turn_index":368,"locator":"[S21T17]","raw_turn_sha256":"67251263e6b7ce37c334370015194941e668d3e0982b685a69cf1f85e3be8f86","rendered_turn_sha256":"c66ee0fb6559499cedce0c1a71374263b1041a98160eb86d3eac6920d5fb7bf4","session_date":"2023-10-04","session_datetime":"2023-10-04T14:44:00","session_id":"session_21","session_index":21,"source_sha256":"798b38ae90192fa702e49c9448195a4b7e4ad0eabceaabd9de29fd3c7af0d1f2","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":17},{"dia_id":"D21:18","global_turn_index":369,"locator":"[S21T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"00f4073a362f98259a9e2b4c9b361332729c8a3bccc5602e5bc5cb852103d0da","rendered_turn_sha256":"574a98fbd9b8fbe3eab489cbcd24c4a4f8bf42029c02342a243b90b8d00bcc02","session_date":"2023-10-04","session_datetime":"2023-10-04T14:44:00","session_id":"session_21","session_index":21,"source_sha256":"66e792d23fbc90e95ab194825b7f6e3318d67af0b24b6ae24a0c2840967a637a","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-10-04, caught up with Dave (\"Hey Dave!\"): told him he met with \"incredible\" artists in Boston the day before (2023-10-03) and talked about working together — arranged through a mutual friend who \"knew we'd be a great fit\" — and is \"stoked to collaborate with them on new music\" (\"an inspiring and exciting experience\"; Dave: \"Awesome! ... Can't wait to hear what you come up with in your collaboration. Let me know how it goes!\"; Calvin: \"Can't wait to show you the final result.\" — details in ## Music); the chat then switched to relaxing hobbies: Calvin said he loves working on a car project \"to chill out\" and shared a photo of a shiny orange car with its hood open (details in ## Music); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin, that car looks great! Working on cars really helps me relax, it's therapeutic to see them come back to life\" and told him he's been restoring the Ford Mustang he found in a junkyard — \"in bad shape, but I knew it had potential\" (details in /memories/dave.md, Car mod workshop (2023-08-11) section); Calvin asked for photos of it \"looking amazing\" (\"I'd love to see how it turned out!\"); Dave shared a photo of a red car parked in a field with other cars — \"I put in a lot of work restoring it, but the result is awesome. It's so satisfying to bring an old car back to life.\"; Calvin: \"We've been greatly privileged to have been granted this opportunity. It's so satisfying to bring it back to life!\" and shared a photo of dirty hands next to a car, and Dave shared a photo of his own dirt-stained hands after a day in the garage — \"permanently stained with grease. But it's worth it when you see the end result.\" Calvin: \"Yeah, Dave! Those hands show you worked hard. You put in lots of effort. You should definitely be proud!\", and the two closed the chat with mutual encouragement — both agreed it's motivating and inspiring to see the progress and development in their projects and in themselves, that those little wins give a sense of accomplishment and bring joy, and that hard work, dedication, and determination are key to reaching their goals and potential and what sets them apart, and that they'll never give up and keep pushing for more — Calvin: \"those little wins matter... It's truly inspiring to see how much we can grow,\" \"Agreed, Dave!... Let's never give up and keep striving for success... Onwards to our goals!\" and Dave: \"It's the small successes that make me feel proud and fulfilled,\" \"Hard work really does pay off!\", \"It's really motivating and keeps me pushing for more.\", \"Let's keep going! We won't lose focus on our goals. Hard work and determination will get us there. Let's do this!\"; the chat then closed with final goodbyes — Calvin: \"Yeah, let's do it! Let's stay focused and work hard to make our dreams happen. We can make it happen together! Wishing you all the best until we meet again!\" and Dave: \"Yep, Calvin! Together, we can do amazing things if we work together and stay motivated. We got this! Take care and stay well!\" (Calvin's car-project details in ## Music; Dave's side of the whole exchange, including his small-successes sentiment, in the 2023-10-04 entry of the Relationships section and the Hobbies and sense of purpose section of /memories/dave.md) [S21T1][S21T2][S21T3][S21T4][S21T5][S21T6][S21T7][S21T8][S21T9][S21T10][S21T11][S21T12][S21T13][S21T14][S21T15][S21T16][S21T17][S21T18].","text_sha256":"7672e13fcdcac3c5bd2ba2a526d2c518bbc8fada4544c6c4a4bf06d40230f27f","timestamp":"2023-10-04T14:44:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D21:1","D21:2","D21:3","D21:4","D21:5","D21:6","D21:7","D21:8","D21:9","D21:10","D21:11","D21:12","D21:13","D21:14","D21:15","D21:16","D21:17","D21:18"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":213,"line_start":213,"source_locators":["[S21T1]","[S21T2]","[S21T3]","[S21T4]","[S21T5]","[S21T6]","[S21T7]","[S21T8]","[S21T9]","[S21T10]","[S21T11]","[S21T12]","[S21T13]","[S21T14]","[S21T15]","[S21T16]","[S21T17]","[S21T18]"],"text_sha256":"934d854db8797b9dadc90d54225e554d496f545e2000d71f37263ff62d849b10"}],"dia_ids":["D21:1","D21:2","D21:3","D21:4","D21:5","D21:6","D21:7","D21:8","D21:9","D21:10","D21:11","D21:12","D21:13","D21:14","D21:15","D21:16","D21:17","D21:18